"shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Coffee & Tea, Food","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"8uF-bhJFgT4Tn6DTb27viA","review_id":"i7tgya1KOeCOngBRhBwamw","date":"2013-12-14T01:41:23","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.955041766166687,"text_excerpt":"Seeing friends post pictures of donuts, reading reviews about this place, and hour long conversations with coworkers about donuts and sweets has led me to District Donuts. I have been wanting to come here ever since I heard about their Vietnamese Coffee donut a few weeks ago. Thankfully this place is on the ride home from my job and I was able to go with little navigation problems. Located on Magazine Street, it also has its own parking lot that is a bit frustrating. Tight and cramped, Reminiscent of Bubbies Manoa ? Oh the horror of parking here, at least it is free! Now onto the donuts! So their flavors of donuts varies everyday, sadly I was unable to get the Vietnamese Ice Coffee one on..."},{"business_id":"8uF-bhJFgT4Tn6DTb27viA","review_id":"1f2i_klgSByO-jZcQ2T04g","date":"2013-12-04T16:03:20","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.948166012763977,"text_excerpt":"So...After being tortured by Yelpers John L. H. and Kim-Thao H. drool-inducing photos of donuts and sliders and having individuals react like I had just said Justin Timberlake had walked in the door when I mentioned DDSB, I had to make my way over to the District Donuts Sliders Brew, not to be confused with The District ( a bar in the CBD). If you end up at The District, you are going to be sorely disappointed if you're looking for the D,S or the B. The first time, I grabbed a sandwich from Stein's next door because it was looking pretty packed seating-wise, but decided I'd get two donuts to go from DDSB. The line goes pretty quickly and I was picked two donuts in Jeopardy Final Round tim..."},{"business_id":"8uF-bhJFgT4Tn6DTb27viA","review_id":"B_SK0PHE_zl4yodQY9ml0g","date":"2014-06-24T11:55:45","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9466425180435181,"text_excerpt":"Super cool place, wish that we had more time to get the sliders, especially since I just saw on Instagram that they have soft shell crab ones. We rolled in here on a Friday morning for some donuts, coffee, and some breakfast sandwich biscuits, we found them all here. The space is very cool and the staff are very friendly. The donuts are super awesome, big, and sugary so just be aware. We got a coffee, some chocolate milk, the glazed, the chocolate, and the banana pudding donuts. Out of all the donuts I have to say that the banana pudding one was my favorite. We also ordered a few of the breakfast sandwiches and they were also very good, the biscuits were killer as was the bacon. All in al..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"8uF-bhJFgT4Tn6DTb27viA","photo_id":"LuLzDPxdy0YPsbg-AJBONg","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/LuLzDPxdy0YPsbg-AJBONg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8731933236122131},{"business_id":"8uF-bhJFgT4Tn6DTb27viA","photo_id":"QJlZPt_t9eegzNvBR0cwRA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/QJlZPt_t9eegzNvBR0cwRA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.854503870010376},{"business_id":"8uF-bhJFgT4Tn6DTb27viA","photo_id":"nqQT82JReWLAS_yp0sYzoQ","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/nqQT82JReWLAS_yp0sYzoQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8489794731140137},{"business_id":"8uF-bhJFgT4Tn6DTb27viA","photo_id":"G8bd9-wnHwMavd3rKP9q9w","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/G8bd9-wnHwMavd3rKP9q9w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8178051114082336},{"business_id":"8uF-bhJFgT4Tn6DTb27viA","photo_id":"XP4H--8FeelruXZHXrbq9Q","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/XP4H--8FeelruXZHXrbq9Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8125251531600952}]},"notebook_case":null}
